{
  "name": "Traitement des factures",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0001-0001-0001-000000000001",
      "name": "Nouveau fichier dans entrant",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.localFileTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [240, 300],
      "parameters": {
        "path": "/data/factures/entrant",
        "events": ["add"],
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0002-0002-0002-000000000002",
      "name": "Lire le fichier",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.readBinaryFile",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [480, 300],
      "parameters": {
        "filePath": "={{ $json.path }}"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0003-0003-0003-000000000003",
      "name": "Envoyer a l API",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4,
      "position": [720, 300],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://host.docker.internal:8000/factures/",
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "multipart-form-data",
        "bodyParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "parameterType": "formBinaryData",
              "name": "fichier",
              "inputDataFieldName": "data"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "timeout": 120000,
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "fullResponse": false
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0004-0004-0004-000000000004",
      "name": "Routage par statut",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.switch",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [960, 300],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "rules",
        "rules": {
          "values": [
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": false,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "strict"
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.statut }}",
                    "rightValue": "prete",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "prete"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": false,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "strict"
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.statut }}",
                    "rightValue": "a_verifier",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "a_verifier"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": false,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "strict"
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.statut }}",
                    "rightValue": "doublon",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "doublon"
            }
          ]
        },
        "fallbackOutput": "extra"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0005-0005-0005-000000000005",
      "name": "Prete a valider",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [1200, 120],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "assign-001",
              "name": "statut",
              "value": "prete",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "assign-002",
              "name": "message",
              "value": "={{ 'Facture ' + $json.fichier + ' prete a valider (id=' + $json.id + ')' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "assign-003",
              "name": "id_facture",
              "value": "={{ $json.id }}",
              "type": "number"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0006-0006-0006-000000000006",
      "name": "A verifier manuellement",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [1200, 300],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "assign-004",
              "name": "statut",
              "value": "a_verifier",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "assign-005",
              "name": "message",
              "value": "={{ 'ALERTE : Facture ' + $json.fichier + ' a verifier (divergence ou OCR faible)' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "assign-006",
              "name": "id_facture",
              "value": "={{ $json.id }}",
              "type": "number"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0007-0007-0007-000000000007",
      "name": "Doublon detecte",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [1200, 480],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "assign-007",
              "name": "statut",
              "value": "doublon",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "assign-008",
              "name": "message",
              "value": "={{ 'DOUBLON : ' + $json.fichier + ' deja presente en base' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "assign-009",
              "name": "id_facture",
              "value": "={{ $json.id }}",
              "type": "number"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0008-0008-0008-000000000008",
      "name": "Note : webhook alternatif",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [240, 540],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Declencheur alternatif : Webhook\n\nPour appeler le workflow directement depuis un script ou Streamlit :\n\n1. Ajouter un noeud **Webhook** (methode POST, chemin `facture`)\n2. Le connecter a \"Lire le fichier\" ou directement a \"Envoyer a l API\"\n   en passant les donnees binaires dans le body.\n\nL URL sera : `http://localhost:5678/webhook/facture`\n\n## Volume Docker\n\nn8n monte `./donnees` en `/data/factures`.\nDeposer les fichiers dans `donnees/entrant/` pour declencher ce workflow.",
        "height": 240,
        "width": 400,
        "color": 5
      }
    }
  ],
